WEBVTT

01:40.570 --> 01:44.310
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.130 --> 01:47.120
[Episode 6]

02:59.190 --> 03:01.310
You're so young, yet your memory is so poor.

03:01.910 --> 03:03.230
Don't you know how to make a wish?

03:04.710 --> 03:05.910
Let me make the wish for you then.

03:07.510 --> 03:09.390
Yuanzhong, the High Priest of Fox Clan,

03:09.830 --> 03:10.750
in the days to come,

03:10.750 --> 03:12.350
you will be very happy.

03:12.550 --> 03:13.230
You will have

03:13.230 --> 03:14.870
new family and friends.

03:15.430 --> 03:17.710
Your life will be lively, ordinary, and carefree.

03:18.350 --> 03:20.030
You will live to a ripe old age,

03:20.240 --> 03:22.030
and just like all ordinary people,

03:22.310 --> 03:23.790
be surrounded by your descendants.

03:23.990 --> 03:25.230
You'll live out your life

03:25.230 --> 03:26.400
in a warm bed.

03:26.630 --> 03:28.110
This is my blessing for you.

03:28.270 --> 03:29.550
It will surely come true.

03:50.090 --> 03:52.329
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

03:52.360 --> 03:54.560
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

03:54.590 --> 03:58.750
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

03:58.770 --> 04:00.970
♫If between oaths♫

04:01.000 --> 04:03.200
♫I hold onto the longing for just one more glance♫

04:03.220 --> 04:06.850
♫Unwilling to bid farewell for good♫

04:07.390 --> 04:09.590
♫Tears fill a cup♫

04:09.620 --> 04:11.820
♫Longing fades in half♫

04:11.950 --> 04:16.490
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

04:16.750 --> 04:23.360
♫A thousand years of long nights, yearning from dawn to dusk♫

04:23.390 --> 04:24.230
What are you doing?

04:31.150 --> 04:31.950
I...

04:34.150 --> 04:35.310
I was trying to...

04:35.870 --> 04:37.390
To help you remove the golden hoop.

04:38.110 --> 04:39.270
But it seems this method

04:39.270 --> 04:40.310
isn't particularly effective.

04:40.710 --> 04:42.350
I'll go think of another way right now.

04:46.190 --> 04:47.110
High Priest?

04:47.630 --> 04:48.430
Explain yourself.

04:49.550 --> 04:50.350
I...

04:51.390 --> 04:52.230
I've gone mad.

04:52.670 --> 04:53.470
Gone mad?

04:54.500 --> 04:55.790
You don't look like it to me.

04:56.710 --> 04:57.909
I had a nightmare.

04:57.950 --> 04:58.950
What did you dream about?

04:59.510 --> 05:00.670
I dreamed you were poisoned,

05:00.910 --> 05:02.150
and I was trying to cure you.

05:02.400 --> 05:04.080
How bold of you.

05:05.020 --> 05:06.370
You're getting more and more presumptuous.

05:07.190 --> 05:08.030
I know I was wrong.

05:08.030 --> 05:08.950
I'll leave right away.

05:13.870 --> 05:15.510
I've long felt something was wrong with you.

05:16.150 --> 05:17.470
There's nothing wrong with me.

05:17.750 --> 05:19.190
Yesterday, you said those things,

05:19.670 --> 05:21.620
and today, you threw yourself at me.

05:21.750 --> 05:22.830
What are you trying to do?

05:22.830 --> 05:24.310
I didn't throw myself at you.

05:24.310 --> 05:25.350
Who sent you here?

05:25.830 --> 05:26.630
Yandu City?

05:30.950 --> 05:32.070
I really am not...

05:32.150 --> 05:33.230
Let me tell you,

05:33.710 --> 05:35.120
don't set your sights on me.

05:35.230 --> 05:36.710
I have no interest in you.

05:38.310 --> 05:39.590
I don't have interest in you either.

05:40.010 --> 05:40.810
Stubborn.

05:45.030 --> 05:46.070
High Priest,

05:46.090 --> 05:46.970
the Elders request your presence.

05:52.159 --> 05:54.240
These years I've been busy with cultivation,

05:52.310 --> 05:54.420
[Hall of Elders]

05:54.430 --> 05:56.030
and I'm not familiar with

05:56.030 --> 05:57.030
the clan's affairs.

05:57.430 --> 05:58.390
I don't know why

05:58.590 --> 05:59.990
you've called me here.

06:01.030 --> 06:01.830
Here's the thing.

06:02.710 --> 06:03.950
You're aware of the incident

06:03.950 --> 06:05.160
with Tanghua today.

06:05.190 --> 06:07.170
We suspect it was the work of the War Demons.

06:07.470 --> 06:08.550
If it's true,

06:08.790 --> 06:10.070
then our clan is in danger.

06:10.630 --> 06:12.390
So the Elders propose

06:12.430 --> 06:14.190
to remove your golden hoop,

06:14.590 --> 06:16.550
so we can face the War Demons' attack together.

06:16.600 --> 06:19.110
What do you think, High Priest?

06:19.730 --> 06:20.820
Remove the golden hoop?

06:21.070 --> 06:21.860
Yes.

06:22.110 --> 06:23.230
How can that do?

06:23.910 --> 06:25.150
To achieve godhood,

06:25.180 --> 06:26.940
I've enlightened myself on Tianqu Peak for 40 years

06:27.430 --> 06:29.270
and cultivated in Liujiao Palace for another 20.

06:29.750 --> 06:30.630
Now I'm just one step away

06:30.630 --> 06:31.790
from becoming a god.

06:31.950 --> 06:33.150
How can I give up halfway?

06:33.420 --> 06:34.550
But the War Demons are

06:34.550 --> 06:35.909
about to attack now.

06:36.210 --> 06:38.120
Other than you, no one in our clan

06:38.140 --> 06:39.710
can resist the War Demons.

06:40.710 --> 06:41.800
Rest assured, Lord Wenying.

06:42.550 --> 06:44.110
As long as I can attain godhood,

06:44.180 --> 06:45.060
everyone in our clan

06:45.060 --> 06:46.790
can follow my example to cultivate.

06:46.909 --> 06:49.070
Then we can all ascend to the Divine Realm together.

06:49.110 --> 06:50.110
Those War Demons

06:50.140 --> 06:51.620
will no longer be a threat to us.

06:51.750 --> 06:52.870
I'm afraid that before

06:52.870 --> 06:54.500
you attain godhood,

06:54.830 --> 06:56.030
we will all be annihilated

06:56.030 --> 06:57.390
by the War Demons.

06:58.100 --> 06:59.909
High Priest, listen to me.

07:00.300 --> 07:02.100
You can cultivate anytime,

07:02.480 --> 07:04.190
but if the War Demons really attack,

07:04.210 --> 07:06.190
all will be lost.

07:06.230 --> 07:07.580
Lord Wenying is right.

07:07.790 --> 07:09.150
Temporarily giving up

07:09.150 --> 07:10.710
can also be seen as a form of cultivation.

07:11.150 --> 07:12.350
You are too insistent on

07:12.350 --> 07:13.430
attaining godhood.

07:13.510 --> 07:14.830
It's also a kind of obsession.

07:15.310 --> 07:17.150
We all have your best interests at heart.

07:17.630 --> 07:19.990
Please don't harm yourself with the wrong choice.

07:22.470 --> 07:23.390
Is that so?

07:24.170 --> 07:24.970
Yes, indeed.

07:28.030 --> 07:28.630
Elder Dingxu,

07:28.630 --> 07:29.910
do you also think this way?

07:32.430 --> 07:33.430
All the Elders

07:34.890 --> 07:35.890
have made valid points.

07:39.590 --> 07:40.390
Very well then.

07:41.470 --> 07:42.700
I'll do as you say.

07:44.550 --> 07:45.390
Then, Dingxu,

07:45.830 --> 07:46.950
undo the seal

07:46.950 --> 07:48.110
for the High Priest now.

07:49.430 --> 07:51.310
I still need to make some preparations.

07:51.390 --> 07:53.000
I'll remove the seal in three days.

07:53.550 --> 07:55.380
What do you think, High Priest?

07:57.000 --> 07:58.320
Let's make it five days later.

08:00.320 --> 08:01.130
Why?

08:01.390 --> 08:03.710
Five days later will be April 6th,

08:04.270 --> 08:05.430
a day when all wishes come true,

08:05.630 --> 08:06.910
all endeavors succeed,

08:07.260 --> 08:08.470
the old is discarded and the new welcomed,

08:09.230 --> 08:10.510
and nothing is taboo.

08:11.390 --> 08:12.910
It's an auspicious day.

08:14.670 --> 08:15.470
Alright,

08:16.580 --> 08:17.820
five days later it is.

08:40.010 --> 08:41.260
My son is sick.

08:41.429 --> 08:43.020
I'm here to get food for him.

08:43.020 --> 08:44.670
No, he must come himself.

08:44.950 --> 08:45.870
For the two of us,

08:45.870 --> 08:46.470
this amount is not enough to eat.

08:46.470 --> 08:47.440
Stop dawdling and get going.

08:53.190 --> 08:54.560
[War Demon Clan, Qian Lin]

09:00.230 --> 09:01.030
Stop right there!

09:06.870 --> 09:08.870
Don't run! Don't run!

09:09.070 --> 09:09.950
Stop fighting!

09:11.430 --> 09:12.390
Everyone, please stop fighting!

09:13.590 --> 09:15.350
Stop fighting! Stop it!

09:25.760 --> 09:26.670
Let me go!

09:27.550 --> 09:28.780
[War Demon Clan, Ming Zhang]

09:30.380 --> 09:31.170
Let me go!

09:35.980 --> 09:36.770
General,

09:36.910 --> 09:38.310
this kid snuck in under the cover of night.

09:38.060 --> 09:38.790
[Tongshan]

09:38.310 --> 09:39.150
He's got some nerve.

09:40.230 --> 09:41.150
Do you know that

09:41.350 --> 09:43.270
changing towns without permission is strictly forbidden?

09:43.270 --> 09:44.030
Let go of me!

09:44.030 --> 09:45.150
You've got quite a mouth on you.

09:45.830 --> 09:46.910
You came from Tongshan?

09:47.410 --> 09:49.290
It's a thousand miles from Tongshan to here.

09:49.670 --> 09:50.900
You've got some skills.

09:51.110 --> 09:52.470
Tongshan is nothing.

09:52.570 --> 09:53.810
I've been everywhere.

09:56.710 --> 09:57.830
That's quite a boast.

10:12.310 --> 10:13.430
Are all these yours?

10:16.100 --> 10:17.390
You bastard!

10:18.630 --> 10:20.550
I ask, you answer.

10:21.300 --> 10:22.100
What's your name?

10:24.070 --> 10:24.860
Speak.

10:28.150 --> 10:28.950
Qian Lin.

10:30.390 --> 10:31.310
Qian Lin.

10:32.510 --> 10:33.310
Tell me.

10:33.860 --> 10:35.150
Where did these come from?

10:35.310 --> 10:36.430
Why are you asking?

10:39.150 --> 10:40.710
You're quite tough, aren't you?

10:41.110 --> 10:42.150
Since we're of the same clan,

10:42.310 --> 10:43.670
you should know the rules, right?

10:44.470 --> 10:46.750
All hidden towns of the War Demon Clan are classified.

10:47.670 --> 10:49.120
To prevent outsiders from knowing,

10:49.150 --> 10:50.790
unless there's a personal written order from each settlement's leader,

10:50.790 --> 10:51.630
no one

10:51.630 --> 10:53.110
is allowed to enter or leave without permission.

11:02.790 --> 11:04.620
You've been to all five settlements.

11:06.870 --> 11:07.990
You've got some nerve.

11:08.790 --> 11:09.590
What are you looking for?

11:10.950 --> 11:12.430
I got bored staying in one place.

11:12.670 --> 11:13.710
I'm just wandering around.

11:15.470 --> 11:16.500
Do you think I believe that?

11:16.500 --> 11:17.710
Believe it or not, it's up to you.

11:41.540 --> 11:43.180
The world is our clan's enemy.

11:44.190 --> 11:45.190
Where we hide

11:45.190 --> 11:46.630
is our biggest secret.

11:46.650 --> 11:47.660
Do you know

11:48.030 --> 11:49.110
what you've done today can be considered

11:49.110 --> 11:50.750
either a major or minor offense?

11:50.990 --> 11:52.230
I can let you go,

11:52.870 --> 11:54.670
or I can have you killed with just one word.

11:56.070 --> 11:57.390
No matter what you want to do,

11:59.780 --> 12:00.820
if you lose your life,

12:01.150 --> 12:02.510
you won't be able to do anything.

12:08.060 --> 12:09.440
The settlements are scattered far and wide.

12:11.110 --> 12:12.470
Even the clan's administrators

12:12.470 --> 12:14.100
may not know their exact locations.

12:15.430 --> 12:17.390
You've managed to visit all five places on your own.

12:17.710 --> 12:19.030
That makes you quite talented.

12:19.630 --> 12:20.440
I value talent.

12:22.470 --> 12:23.870
I want to keep you in Gushan

12:24.040 --> 12:25.000
to join us and receive training.

12:25.300 --> 12:26.390
If you accept,

12:26.790 --> 12:27.790
I can pretend

12:28.700 --> 12:30.120
that nothing happened today.

12:31.550 --> 12:32.350
Really?

12:35.230 --> 12:36.670
Dingxu must have noticed.

12:37.270 --> 12:38.550
He's not a fool.

12:38.710 --> 12:39.790
Proceed as planned.

12:39.790 --> 12:40.430
Yes.

12:55.470 --> 12:56.260
Open the door.

12:57.750 --> 12:58.700
I'm already sleeping.

12:59.260 --> 13:01.420
Whatever it is, let's talk tomorrow.

13:03.240 --> 13:04.030
Open the door.

13:05.350 --> 13:07.110
I told you I'm already sleeping.

13:07.460 --> 13:08.670
I've already taken off my clothes.

13:09.380 --> 13:10.390
If you don't open the door,

13:10.390 --> 13:11.740
I'll break it down.

13:12.430 --> 13:13.780
This door is made of oak.

13:13.780 --> 13:14.630
It's very sturdy.

13:14.630 --> 13:16.070
You can't break it down.

13:16.110 --> 13:17.340
Zi Fei, break it down.

13:17.880 --> 13:19.710
Ji Tanyin, I'm going to break it down.

13:20.470 --> 13:21.260
Wait, wait!

13:25.350 --> 13:26.750
Didn't you say you'd taken off your clothes?

13:28.410 --> 13:29.810
I... I put them back on.

13:29.920 --> 13:31.240
You dressed quite quickly.

13:36.950 --> 13:37.750
Get out.

13:37.950 --> 13:38.750
I...

13:43.430 --> 13:44.430
What are you doing?

13:45.950 --> 13:47.190
What can I do?

13:47.470 --> 13:48.740
Of course, I'm going to do

13:49.030 --> 13:50.590
what hasn't been finished yet.

13:51.830 --> 13:52.710
I-I...

13:52.710 --> 13:54.190
I really didn't mean anything else.

13:54.380 --> 13:55.910
I just wanted to see

13:56.070 --> 13:57.630
if I could remove your golden hoop.

13:59.770 --> 14:01.970
You think you can remove my golden hoop by seducing me?

14:02.430 --> 14:03.230
I...

14:03.590 --> 14:05.380
Did the human race send you to seduce me?

14:06.150 --> 14:07.070
Their plan this time

14:07.070 --> 14:08.020
is quite unique.

14:08.500 --> 14:09.950
They sent someone like you.

14:10.630 --> 14:12.390
I told you I'm not trying to seduce you.

14:15.960 --> 14:17.390
It's not what you think.

14:22.120 --> 14:23.350
Why would I like you?

14:23.350 --> 14:24.950
How could I possibly like you?

14:25.590 --> 14:26.390
You're young

14:26.390 --> 14:27.270
and not very bright.

14:27.270 --> 14:28.670
You've been fooled so badly.

14:28.670 --> 14:29.390
What's there about you

14:29.390 --> 14:30.190
that's worth liking?

14:30.190 --> 14:30.830
You...

14:35.920 --> 14:37.090
New trick.

14:37.590 --> 14:38.790
Playing hard to get.

14:40.390 --> 14:41.600
Aren't you afraid of angering me?

14:42.110 --> 14:43.470
Get out, get out, get out!

14:43.470 --> 14:44.430
I can't explain it to you clearly.

14:44.430 --> 14:46.270
Go, go, go! Get out!

14:46.270 --> 14:47.030
I...

14:50.750 --> 14:51.630
Ji Tanyin,

14:52.140 --> 14:53.270
have you lost your mind?

14:54.190 --> 14:54.950
As a handmaiden,

14:54.950 --> 14:56.120
how dare you!

14:56.540 --> 14:57.860
Don't test me or I'll set

14:58.270 --> 14:59.670
your house on fire?

15:00.110 --> 15:00.870
Calm down.

15:00.910 --> 15:02.550
If you want, I'll go get some firewood.

15:03.870 --> 15:04.670
Move aside!

15:37.430 --> 15:38.510
Why did you

15:38.790 --> 15:40.800
agree to lift Yuanzhong's seal?

15:42.470 --> 15:44.150
All these years, except for me,

15:44.790 --> 15:46.470
you've had the most contact with him.

15:47.510 --> 15:48.550
Is he really

15:48.550 --> 15:50.470
as he appears to be?

15:51.710 --> 15:53.070
You should know best.

15:53.460 --> 15:54.270
Don't move.

15:56.390 --> 15:57.190
Does it hurt?

15:59.990 --> 16:02.190
If this hurts,

16:02.990 --> 16:03.910
then what about him?

16:04.220 --> 16:05.350
For 20 years,

16:05.470 --> 16:07.350
he had the spirit refinement every 10 days.

16:07.540 --> 16:08.930
How painful must that be?

16:09.310 --> 16:10.830
I don't know the truth

16:11.070 --> 16:12.020
about the possession.

16:12.430 --> 16:14.310
I've been taking care of the High Priest for 20 years.

16:15.070 --> 16:15.750
I can't tell

16:15.750 --> 16:17.270
what he's really thinking,

16:18.430 --> 16:21.260
just as I can't see through you.

16:27.190 --> 16:28.430
After all these years,

16:28.710 --> 16:29.830
you've confined him,

16:30.020 --> 16:30.960
tortured him,

16:31.150 --> 16:32.110
sealed him.

16:32.750 --> 16:34.830
Is it really for the benefit of our clan,

16:35.390 --> 16:37.310
or for your own selfish reasons?

16:38.020 --> 16:40.310
I don't know that either.

16:40.780 --> 16:41.550
I can only follow

16:41.550 --> 16:42.910
my own heart now.

16:45.110 --> 16:45.900
Dingxu,

16:46.950 --> 16:48.590
we were wrong back then.

16:49.110 --> 16:50.350
We hurt him

16:50.630 --> 16:51.830
and then we feared him,

16:52.390 --> 16:53.870
so we deceived him.

16:54.300 --> 16:55.490
It's been 60 years.

16:56.390 --> 16:57.580
That's enough.

16:58.090 --> 16:59.090
Have you considered

17:00.280 --> 17:03.530
that if he already knows the truth,

17:03.990 --> 17:05.710
then everything he's shown

17:05.710 --> 17:07.390
could all be fake?

17:07.829 --> 17:08.750
All of this

17:08.770 --> 17:10.569
might be his plan.

17:11.710 --> 17:12.790
If that's the case

17:13.869 --> 17:15.710
and we rashly lift the seal,

17:16.030 --> 17:17.310
what will we face?

17:17.869 --> 17:19.069
I'm not sure about that,

17:19.920 --> 17:20.950
but I know

17:21.500 --> 17:23.140
this is what we deserve.

17:23.490 --> 17:24.810
It's our retribution.

17:26.130 --> 17:28.420
Grand Elder, you should rest well.

17:29.070 --> 17:30.900
You're already 480 years old,

17:31.550 --> 17:33.700
nearing the limit of our clan's lifespan.

17:34.230 --> 17:35.870
Your medical skills are excellent

17:36.030 --> 17:37.750
and you can create life-extending elixirs,

17:38.150 --> 17:39.300
but what belongs to others

17:39.650 --> 17:41.170
ultimately doesn't belong to you.

18:17.300 --> 18:18.100
Zi Fei.

18:18.640 --> 18:20.110
Yuanzhong, you're awake.

18:23.490 --> 18:24.420
What's all this?

18:24.750 --> 18:25.980
Ji Tanyin made all of this.

18:26.650 --> 18:27.450
All of it?

18:28.270 --> 18:29.470
She made all these in one night.

18:29.470 --> 18:30.150
Impressive, isn't it?

18:30.150 --> 18:31.510
I can't move them as fast as she makes them.

18:31.510 --> 18:32.870
Why did she make so many tables and chairs?

18:33.340 --> 18:34.260
I don't know either.

18:34.510 --> 18:36.230
She also made me a wheelchair.

18:36.250 --> 18:37.890
You know, the kind with wheels underneath.

18:37.930 --> 18:39.930
I just push with my legs and it moves.

18:40.030 --> 18:41.030
She made one for you too.

18:41.030 --> 18:41.880
It's in the storeroom.

18:41.880 --> 18:42.760
Let me bring it for you.

18:53.350 --> 18:54.150
Ji Tanyin.

18:54.360 --> 18:55.450
What are you doing?

18:56.390 --> 18:57.190
Working.

18:57.360 --> 18:58.350
Who told you to do this?

18:58.720 --> 18:59.950
I'm thinking about things.

19:00.230 --> 19:01.270
When I'm thinking,

19:01.270 --> 19:02.680
I have to keep my hands busy.

19:03.370 --> 19:04.220
What are you thinking about?

19:05.740 --> 19:06.950
I'm talking to you.

19:07.630 --> 19:08.780
You're so annoying.

19:08.990 --> 19:09.630
Are men

19:09.630 --> 19:10.870
all this talkative?

19:10.870 --> 19:11.550
Or is it that

19:11.550 --> 19:12.750
only men from the Youhu Clan

19:12.750 --> 19:13.630
are like this?

19:14.470 --> 19:15.470
I'm talkative?

19:19.030 --> 19:19.820
Fine.

19:20.150 --> 19:21.630
Since it's come to this,

19:21.630 --> 19:23.030
let's make it clear.

19:23.190 --> 19:24.260
Earlier, I made three rules with you,

19:24.260 --> 19:25.470
but I only mentioned the first two.

19:25.470 --> 19:26.310
Now I'm going to tell you

19:26.310 --> 19:27.150
the third one.

19:27.220 --> 19:28.640
Who wants to hear your third rule?

19:29.030 --> 19:29.960
The third rule is

19:29.960 --> 19:30.710
absolutely, absolutely

19:30.710 --> 19:32.110
do not develop feelings for me.

19:35.790 --> 19:37.000
Our relationship is just that of the High Priest

19:37.000 --> 19:37.710
and his handmaiden.

19:37.710 --> 19:38.550
There will be nothing else,

19:38.550 --> 19:39.430
understand?

19:40.200 --> 19:41.500
Ji Tanyin, are you alright?

19:41.990 --> 19:42.590
Do you want to

19:42.590 --> 19:43.580
write down what you just said

19:43.580 --> 19:43.910
and see for yourself

19:43.910 --> 19:45.070
what you're saying?

19:46.340 --> 19:47.390
I don't have experience.

19:47.510 --> 19:49.350
My actions last night were indeed inappropriate.

19:49.350 --> 19:50.300
I apologize to you.

19:50.300 --> 19:51.430
It won't happen again.

19:51.430 --> 19:52.190
However,

19:53.310 --> 19:54.340
between us,

19:54.670 --> 19:55.950
we need to maintain distance.

19:55.990 --> 19:57.670
Once this golden hoop is removed,

19:57.670 --> 19:58.870
you'll be free again.

19:58.870 --> 20:00.750
Then, whoever you want to be with,

20:00.750 --> 20:01.430
wherever you want to go,

20:01.430 --> 20:02.230
and whatever you want to do

20:02.230 --> 20:02.790
is all up to you.

20:02.790 --> 20:04.110
I absolutely won't interfere.

20:04.310 --> 20:05.750
You can just treat me as...

20:09.710 --> 20:10.670
Treat me as...

20:13.790 --> 20:14.590
Yes,

20:14.590 --> 20:15.400
just treat me as

20:15.400 --> 20:16.670
a god's image hanging on the wall.

20:16.670 --> 20:17.630
I can always bless you

20:17.630 --> 20:18.750
and bring you good luck.

20:19.190 --> 20:20.470
I'll accompany you well

20:20.470 --> 20:21.670
until you die.

20:21.670 --> 20:22.390
Don't worry.

20:22.390 --> 20:23.470
I don't need that.

20:23.710 --> 20:24.360
Zi Fei.

20:25.670 --> 20:26.950
I'm here. What's wrong?

20:26.950 --> 20:28.310
Drive her out!

20:29.040 --> 20:29.870
Where to?

20:29.870 --> 20:31.590
Down the mountain, out of Liujiao Palace.

20:31.610 --> 20:32.970
Don't let her appear in front of me!

20:33.230 --> 20:34.030
I...

20:34.460 --> 20:35.780
And all these stupid things...

20:36.790 --> 20:37.710
Throw them all away!

20:41.520 --> 20:43.480
Y-You're really something.

20:43.630 --> 20:44.540
What?

20:44.630 --> 20:45.940
You're going to anger him to death.

20:45.940 --> 20:46.510
He hasn't been

20:46.510 --> 20:48.060
this angry for many years.

20:48.710 --> 20:50.230
Not even with Elder Dingxu.

20:51.100 --> 20:51.910
This...

20:52.670 --> 20:54.110
Is this a good thing?

20:56.260 --> 20:57.990
For me, it is.

20:58.020 --> 20:58.940
For you, I'm not sure.

21:00.870 --> 21:02.110
Let me be clear.

21:02.110 --> 21:02.870
I'm not leaving.

21:02.990 --> 21:04.340
I want to stay with him

21:04.340 --> 21:05.990
forever, never leaving his side.

21:06.910 --> 21:08.190
You go tell him that.

21:08.630 --> 21:09.430
Also,

21:09.750 --> 21:11.070
you don't need to remove the golden hoop anymore.

21:12.260 --> 21:13.060
Why?

21:13.190 --> 21:14.230
The Council of Elders has decided

21:14.230 --> 21:15.430
to undo his seal

21:15.830 --> 21:17.390
in four days.

21:22.310 --> 21:23.400
Thank you, thank you.

21:25.130 --> 21:26.210
What do you mean you don't know?

21:26.270 --> 21:27.510
Aren't you supposed to find out everything?

21:28.310 --> 21:29.030
Well, I can't

21:29.030 --> 21:30.270
know everything, can I?

21:30.750 --> 21:32.390
If you ask me about high officials

21:32.390 --> 21:33.590
or instructors of various teams,

21:33.630 --> 21:35.310
I might be able to help.

21:35.310 --> 21:35.910
But you're asking about

21:35.910 --> 21:38.390
an ordinary woman who never leaves her house.

21:38.410 --> 21:39.580
I'm afraid I can't help you with that.

21:42.190 --> 21:44.020
Come on, let's talk more.

21:44.020 --> 21:44.750
I'll help you, I'll help you.

21:44.750 --> 21:45.430
I'll help you, I'll help you.

21:45.430 --> 21:45.780
No need.

21:45.780 --> 21:46.590
I'll help you.

21:46.630 --> 21:47.750
Think about it carefully.

21:48.670 --> 21:49.470
Alright,

21:49.620 --> 21:50.990
I'll tell you what I know.

21:51.350 --> 21:52.710
The Gushan hidden town

21:52.710 --> 21:54.830
is the largest among our clan's towns

21:54.830 --> 21:56.270
with the largest population.

21:56.270 --> 21:58.580
Do you know the unchanging rules of our clan?

22:00.990 --> 22:01.830
I know.

22:02.140 --> 22:03.380
All adult men and women

22:03.510 --> 22:05.070
have their marriages arranged by the clan leader.

22:05.100 --> 22:05.950
If they can't produce offspring

22:05.950 --> 22:06.910
after two years of marriage,

22:06.910 --> 22:08.110
they will be forcibly separated

22:08.110 --> 22:09.430
and remarried to others.

22:09.750 --> 22:10.870
After giving birth to one child,

22:10.870 --> 22:11.510
if they can't

22:11.510 --> 22:12.910
produce another one within three years,

22:12.910 --> 22:14.110
they will also be separated.

22:16.670 --> 22:17.790
You're right.

22:17.950 --> 22:18.990
Although it seems inhumane,

22:18.990 --> 22:20.140
after the battle of Pinghu,

22:20.310 --> 22:21.990
our clan was nearly extinct.

22:21.990 --> 22:23.070
Our population was scarce,

22:23.070 --> 22:24.910
and we were hunted down by the Youhu Clan and human race

22:24.910 --> 22:26.230
together.

22:26.550 --> 22:28.390
If it weren't for these iron-fisted rules,

22:28.430 --> 22:30.230
you and I wouldn't be here today.

22:31.550 --> 22:32.710
Over the years,

22:32.830 --> 22:33.710
I've seen many cases

22:33.710 --> 22:34.830
of couple separations and mothers being separated

22:34.830 --> 22:36.310
from their children.

22:36.500 --> 22:37.380
You're not the first one

22:37.380 --> 22:38.510
to come looking for someone.

22:38.870 --> 22:40.310
Let's not even talk about whether your mother

22:40.310 --> 22:41.400
is here or not.

22:41.400 --> 22:43.550
Even if you do find your mother,

22:43.550 --> 22:44.630
she already has a husband

22:44.630 --> 22:45.870
and children.

22:45.910 --> 22:47.470
Do you really think she'd be willing to leave with you?

22:48.000 --> 22:49.790
I won't know until I try.

22:49.790 --> 22:50.750
My father is old now.

22:50.750 --> 22:52.070
He doesn't have much time left.

22:52.070 --> 22:52.790
I need to let him see

22:52.790 --> 22:54.110
my mother one last time before he dies.

22:54.950 --> 22:57.190
Why don't you try finding Granny Gu?

22:57.310 --> 22:58.100
Who?

22:58.870 --> 22:59.910
Granny Gu.

23:00.710 --> 23:02.190
She's a crazy old lady

23:02.270 --> 23:04.350
who survived the Battle of Pinghu.

23:05.310 --> 23:06.350
Her entire family

23:06.510 --> 23:09.470
was killed by the Youhu Clan.

23:09.550 --> 23:10.910
She's most skilled in

23:10.910 --> 23:12.830
witchcraft and curses.

23:13.390 --> 23:15.310
She can communicate with gods.

23:15.590 --> 23:17.230
If she's willing to help you,

23:17.230 --> 23:19.340
you might still have a chance.

23:20.190 --> 23:21.390
Granny Gu.

23:35.110 --> 23:36.670
The High Priest is wise and powerful.

23:36.670 --> 23:38.350
The High Priest has a healthy and long life.

23:55.220 --> 23:56.350
Why aren't you eating?

24:05.150 --> 24:06.390
These are freshly picked.

24:06.710 --> 24:08.430
I rushed over here in a hurry.

24:08.740 --> 24:10.390
The flavor must still be fresh.

24:12.870 --> 24:14.390
Please don't be angry anymore.

24:14.870 --> 24:15.990
Let me apologize to you.

24:16.550 --> 24:17.790
I was wrong yesterday.

24:18.070 --> 24:18.880
But I also ask you

24:18.880 --> 24:20.270
to try to understand me a little.

24:20.510 --> 24:22.340
I've never been a handmaiden before.

24:22.340 --> 24:23.550
I've never served anyone.

24:24.070 --> 24:25.150
So, many times,

24:25.150 --> 24:27.030
I felt that we were equals.

24:27.030 --> 24:27.790
I didn't consider myself

24:27.790 --> 24:29.230
to be your servant.

24:31.390 --> 24:33.270
You make it sound like I forced you

24:33.270 --> 24:34.670
to be my handmaiden.

24:35.030 --> 24:35.910
That's not it.

24:37.820 --> 24:38.990
Anyway, there are many things

24:38.990 --> 24:40.230
I can't tell you.

24:40.510 --> 24:41.470
As long as you're not angry with me,

24:41.470 --> 24:42.350
that's all that matters.

24:44.950 --> 24:46.230
Why would I be angry?

24:46.770 --> 24:48.140
You're just a handmaiden.

24:48.230 --> 24:49.630
If you're not suitable,

24:49.630 --> 24:50.790
I can simply replace you.

24:51.000 --> 24:52.350
Why waste so many words?

24:52.350 --> 24:53.790
I'm different from others.

24:57.230 --> 24:58.270
How are you different?

25:01.470 --> 25:02.630
I'm skilled and dexterous.

25:02.790 --> 25:03.710
Whatever you want,

25:03.710 --> 25:05.350
I can make it all for you.

25:05.430 --> 25:06.590
I'm also knowledgeable and talented.

25:06.590 --> 25:07.900
I know many things.

25:08.110 --> 25:09.580
If you keep me by your side,

25:09.580 --> 25:10.430
it's like

25:10.430 --> 25:11.990
having a mobile library with you.

25:13.150 --> 25:13.830
And also...

25:13.830 --> 25:16.070
These qualities of yours

25:16.710 --> 25:17.870
are worthless to me.

25:20.470 --> 25:21.550
Ji Tanyin, you're very strange.

25:21.550 --> 25:22.470
Do you know that?

25:23.510 --> 25:24.830
Do you know who I am?

25:25.350 --> 25:27.270
I am the High Priest of the Youhu Clan,

25:27.350 --> 25:28.980
the owner of the Divine Left Hand.

25:29.020 --> 25:31.110
I am the person closest to a god in this world.

25:33.540 --> 25:34.940
Everyone approaches me

25:35.350 --> 25:36.630
for a purpose.

25:38.320 --> 25:39.990
If they're not trying to kill me,

25:40.620 --> 25:41.950
they're trying to use me.

25:42.320 --> 25:43.810
They all want something,

25:44.430 --> 25:45.550
but they all pretend

25:45.550 --> 25:47.310
to be ordinary,

25:47.310 --> 25:49.350
as if they're harmless.

25:51.430 --> 25:52.430
But you?

25:58.310 --> 26:01.510
You don't seem ordinary at all.

26:02.310 --> 26:03.990
Every word you've said,

26:03.990 --> 26:05.580
everything you've done,

26:05.980 --> 26:07.430
has been extremely strange.

26:08.240 --> 26:09.470
It's as if you

26:09.470 --> 26:10.750
don't belong in this world.

26:11.830 --> 26:13.150
Yet you don't try to hide

26:13.150 --> 26:14.270
this strangeness at all.

26:15.150 --> 26:15.860
You just

26:15.860 --> 26:17.390
speak so openly

26:17.390 --> 26:19.270
and act so frankly.

26:20.030 --> 26:21.190
I can't figure out

26:21.190 --> 26:23.030
what you really want to do.

26:24.190 --> 26:25.070
Do you know?

26:26.650 --> 26:27.760
This is not good.

26:28.550 --> 26:28.950
I...

26:29.190 --> 26:30.750
I don't want to do anything.

26:31.470 --> 26:32.750
I just want to be with you.

26:32.750 --> 26:34.070
What makes you think

26:34.070 --> 26:35.710
you can be with me for a lifetime?

26:37.110 --> 26:38.070
You're nothing but

26:38.070 --> 26:39.790
a handmaiden.

26:39.950 --> 26:41.710
What gives you the right to

26:41.710 --> 26:43.670
think you're special?

26:43.670 --> 26:45.350
To think I would agree to you?

26:46.620 --> 26:48.750
This confidence and composure of yours...

26:50.660 --> 26:51.940
Where did it come from?

26:53.180 --> 26:53.980
Yuanzhong.

26:54.910 --> 26:56.350
Don't talk like that.

26:56.910 --> 26:58.270
You're a good person.

26:59.110 --> 27:00.830
Good people don't talk like that.

27:04.590 --> 27:06.440
What makes you think I'm a good person?

27:08.670 --> 27:10.430
I saw it in your heart.

27:23.220 --> 27:24.150
Have one.

27:24.550 --> 27:25.950
You love eating this the most.

27:27.210 --> 27:28.780
You're so sad inside.

27:28.800 --> 27:30.000
It's all cold and icy.

27:30.270 --> 27:31.790
But you still think about it.

27:32.110 --> 27:33.510
It's so picky.

27:33.630 --> 27:35.550
Picky about soil and water, picky about sunlight,

27:35.550 --> 27:36.590
picky about location,

27:36.590 --> 27:38.070
yet it can still grow

27:38.070 --> 27:38.870
in your heart.

27:39.030 --> 27:39.830
Evidently,

27:40.000 --> 27:41.550
your heart isn't that cold.

27:41.550 --> 27:42.950
What exactly are you trying to say?

27:43.890 --> 27:45.290
Don't be angry anymore.

27:45.950 --> 27:46.630
I've already

27:46.630 --> 27:48.110
put those chairs away.

27:48.710 --> 27:50.470
I won't steal kisses from you anymore.

27:50.830 --> 27:52.430
I'll take good care of you

27:52.430 --> 27:53.790
and be a good handmaiden.

27:54.310 --> 27:55.110
Oh, right.

27:55.150 --> 27:56.670
Zi Fei has already told me.

27:56.670 --> 27:58.590
Your seal will be undone soon.

27:58.830 --> 27:59.910
That's great.

28:00.110 --> 28:01.590
You'll be free after that.

28:01.590 --> 28:03.030
You can go wherever you want.

28:04.180 --> 28:05.870
You don't know how useful I can be yet.

28:06.270 --> 28:07.590
Once you can go out,

28:07.590 --> 28:08.510
you'll see.

28:08.870 --> 28:10.870
I've been to many places.

28:11.190 --> 28:12.670
I'm really good at finding my way.

28:12.750 --> 28:14.430
I'm skilled, strong,

28:14.670 --> 28:15.670
and I can make money too.

28:16.030 --> 28:16.830
I can do the work of many

28:16.830 --> 28:17.910
by myself.

28:18.430 --> 28:19.230
Also,

28:20.390 --> 28:21.950
I am the person who believes in you the most.

28:22.990 --> 28:24.510
I'm the one who will

28:24.950 --> 28:26.730
never betray you.

28:31.230 --> 28:32.020
Alright.

28:32.310 --> 28:33.390
I'll go cook now.

28:33.690 --> 28:34.490
Oh, right.

28:34.680 --> 28:36.150
Zi Fei has already told me.

28:36.150 --> 28:36.880
For each of your meals.

28:36.880 --> 28:38.260
you need eight meat and eight vegetable dishes.

28:38.470 --> 28:39.550
I've noted it all down.

28:39.990 --> 28:41.550
Today we also have Red Oil Cloud Strings.

28:41.590 --> 28:43.150
I've practiced it a few times secretly.

28:43.510 --> 28:44.470
The taste is not bad.

28:44.470 --> 28:45.350
Wait for me, okay?

29:18.770 --> 29:19.590
Who are you looking for?

29:22.350 --> 29:23.380
Are you looking for Granny Gu?

29:24.500 --> 29:26.070
Yes, does she live here?

29:26.350 --> 29:27.310
Yes, this is the right place.

29:27.410 --> 29:28.850
However, you should come back another day.

29:29.010 --> 29:30.140
The courtyard gate is closed now.

29:30.250 --> 29:32.080
It means Granny Gu isn't seeing visitors today.

30:02.830 --> 30:03.630
Is anyone there?

30:12.280 --> 30:13.370
Are you Granny Gu?

30:23.310 --> 30:24.160
Granny Gu.

30:48.610 --> 30:51.230
[War Demon Clan, Granny Gu]

30:55.000 --> 30:59.200
It's not about being early but being timely.

31:06.950 --> 31:08.580
We can't afford any mistakes this time.

31:08.830 --> 31:10.190
If the information is false,

31:10.340 --> 31:12.710
our embarrassment will be the least of our worries.

31:13.070 --> 31:14.190
Rest assured, Grand Elder.

31:14.550 --> 31:15.620
I have investigated

31:15.790 --> 31:17.230
the possession thoroughly.

31:17.230 --> 31:18.720
We have both testimonial and physical evidence.

31:18.830 --> 31:19.980
The evidence is ironclad.

31:20.230 --> 31:21.340
They can't overturn it.

31:21.590 --> 31:22.390
That's good.

31:22.680 --> 31:23.910
You go prepare first.

31:42.510 --> 31:43.310
Grand Elder,

31:43.450 --> 31:44.820
today is your birthday.

31:44.930 --> 31:45.890
Have a bowl of noodles.

31:47.540 --> 31:49.310
I don't celebrate birthdays.

31:49.310 --> 31:50.500
No outsiders know about it anyway.

31:50.500 --> 31:51.820
It's just for good luck.

31:51.890 --> 31:53.970
I wish you blessings as vast as the East Sea,

31:54.150 --> 31:55.380
and longevity like the Southern Mountains.

32:18.870 --> 32:20.670
The Council of Elders sent a messenger here.

32:20.690 --> 32:21.570
They're calling for you.

32:26.710 --> 32:27.500
How is it?

32:28.160 --> 32:29.370
Your craftsmanship is quite good.

32:29.790 --> 32:31.550
It looks quite similar to that old rascal Dingxu.

32:32.910 --> 32:33.700
Does it?

32:34.150 --> 32:34.960
Yes, it does.

32:46.500 --> 32:48.190
Greetings, High Priest.

32:51.310 --> 32:52.190
Where's Ji Tanyin?

32:53.010 --> 32:54.890
I don't know. Should I go call her?

32:55.950 --> 32:56.750
Let's go.

33:17.390 --> 33:18.390
Isn't it beautiful?

33:20.850 --> 33:21.920
It is beautiful.

33:22.310 --> 33:23.550
But Hannv,

33:23.570 --> 33:24.770
we've been here looking at it

33:24.810 --> 33:26.080
for so long now.

33:26.270 --> 33:27.310
I should go.

33:27.310 --> 33:28.070
You don't have anything

33:28.070 --> 33:29.470
to do in the mortal realm.

33:29.750 --> 33:31.340
Why are you in such a hurry to go back?

33:31.590 --> 33:32.990
I'm not that free either.

33:33.160 --> 33:33.950
Besides,

33:34.920 --> 33:36.390
I don't understand these things.

33:36.710 --> 33:37.990
It's right that you don't understand.

33:38.470 --> 33:40.590
That's why I asked you to observe it.

33:40.990 --> 33:41.670
If you view it

33:41.670 --> 33:43.230
with expectations and assumptions,

33:43.270 --> 33:44.110
the work loses

33:44.110 --> 33:45.270
its original intent.

33:45.290 --> 33:46.440
It will be misinterpreted.

33:49.700 --> 33:51.180
Time in the Divine Realm is lonely.

33:51.670 --> 33:53.670
It's rare to find someone with a compatible temperament.

33:54.790 --> 33:55.590
Tanyin,

33:56.100 --> 33:57.350
in all these years you've been in the mortal realm,

33:57.830 --> 33:59.590
I haven't had anyone to talk to.

34:00.190 --> 34:01.910
You don't know how much I've missed you.

34:02.760 --> 34:04.200
I don't know why,

34:04.770 --> 34:06.530
but I just really like you.

34:10.150 --> 34:12.510
When you first became a god,

34:13.150 --> 34:14.550
I was your guide.

34:15.230 --> 34:17.550
We hit it off right from the start.

34:19.190 --> 34:20.750
Do you remember how I told you

34:20.750 --> 34:21.429
I had a younger sister

34:21.429 --> 34:22.750
before my ascension?

34:23.790 --> 34:25.199
You've mentioned this a few times.

34:25.550 --> 34:26.989
Her embroidery skills were also very good.

34:27.400 --> 34:28.400
It's just a pity

34:28.630 --> 34:29.989
she didn't have much patience.

34:30.469 --> 34:31.630
She couldn't sit still.

34:31.989 --> 34:33.870
She had a lively and outgoing personality.

34:34.750 --> 34:36.190
If only she could be like you,

34:36.190 --> 34:37.350
dedicating herself to her craft,

34:37.750 --> 34:39.070
and ascend with me,

34:40.020 --> 34:41.300
that would have been wonderful.

34:44.630 --> 34:45.670
Hannv.

34:46.510 --> 34:48.510
At least I've had you all these years.

34:49.630 --> 34:50.949
I will always remember

34:50.949 --> 34:52.630
your care for me.

34:53.150 --> 34:54.590
You're just so kind.

34:55.429 --> 34:56.750
During the war between gods and demons,

34:56.790 --> 34:57.880
the celestial ladder was destroyed.

34:58.190 --> 34:59.550
Taihe lost the Divine Hand

34:59.550 --> 35:00.710
and fell into a deep slumber.

35:01.300 --> 35:02.730
Among all the gods in the Divine Realm,

35:02.830 --> 35:03.470
who dared to risk

35:03.470 --> 35:04.850
the destruction of their divine soul

35:05.270 --> 35:06.390
to leap from the Gate of Heaven,

35:06.630 --> 35:08.030
cross the Sea of Flux,

35:08.050 --> 35:09.660
and search for the Divine Hand in the mortal realm?

35:10.180 --> 35:11.060
Only you.

35:11.470 --> 35:13.280
You did it without a word.

35:13.790 --> 35:15.110
Only you treated me as a friend.

35:16.230 --> 35:18.030
You know I can't let go of Taihe.

35:18.790 --> 35:19.830
You were afraid I'd be heartbroken.

35:20.440 --> 35:21.790
It's not entirely like that.

35:22.510 --> 35:23.990
When Deity Taihe was around,

35:24.110 --> 35:25.280
he was also very good to me.

35:25.510 --> 35:26.870
He's the Primordial God,

35:26.930 --> 35:28.170
a very important god.

35:28.820 --> 35:31.290
And because I have craftsmanship skills,

35:31.310 --> 35:33.000
I don't rely entirely on immortal techniques.

35:33.180 --> 35:34.670
My chances of crossing the Sea of Flux

35:34.670 --> 35:35.990
is greater.

35:36.670 --> 35:37.790
You're always like this,

35:38.330 --> 35:39.700
never boasting about your achievements.

35:52.510 --> 35:53.790
Is everyone here?

35:54.150 --> 35:55.150
Grand Elder,

35:55.270 --> 35:56.190
everyone is present.

36:07.390 --> 36:08.710
The Youhu Clan

36:08.710 --> 36:10.790
has propagated since the beginning of primordial chaos

36:10.790 --> 36:12.430
for over 10,000 years.

36:12.480 --> 36:13.550
For these 10,000 years,

36:13.550 --> 36:15.070
our clan has dwelled deep in the mountains,

36:15.150 --> 36:17.320
brewing tea, burning incense, cultivating qi and refining our minds,

36:17.320 --> 36:18.550
staying out of worldly conflicts.

36:18.790 --> 36:21.110
However, in the great war between gods and demons, many gods died,

36:21.190 --> 36:23.350
and the entire War Demon clan turned to the demonic path,

36:23.480 --> 36:25.710
reigniting the flames of war and harming all living beings.

36:26.270 --> 36:27.670
Our clan was fortunate

36:27.670 --> 36:28.820
to wield divine artifacts

36:28.820 --> 36:30.470
and save countless people from calamity.

36:30.630 --> 36:31.710
In the Battle of Pinghu,

36:31.870 --> 36:33.580
the High Priest led our clan

36:33.580 --> 36:34.750
and wiped out the War Demons's army

36:34.750 --> 36:35.990
of 200,000 soldiers.

36:36.220 --> 36:37.150
Though it was brutal,

36:37.430 --> 36:38.230
it brought about

36:38.230 --> 36:40.230
60 years of peace and prosperity.

36:41.990 --> 36:43.510
Sixty years have passed.

36:43.630 --> 36:44.830
Your weapons

36:45.110 --> 36:46.950
must be rusty and dusty by now, right?

36:52.990 --> 36:54.180
But this is a good thing.

36:54.870 --> 36:56.310
Who would want to touch weapons

36:56.670 --> 36:58.310
when there are good days to enjoy?

36:58.750 --> 37:00.000
Even the High Priest

37:00.110 --> 37:01.470
could seal away his divine artifact

37:01.470 --> 37:02.390
to plant flowers, raise fish,

37:02.420 --> 37:03.810
and live in leisure.

37:04.310 --> 37:05.590
What's wrong with us

37:05.790 --> 37:07.070
being a bit lazy?

37:07.550 --> 37:08.350
Unfortunately,

37:08.350 --> 37:10.270
the tree desires stillness, but the wind refuses to stop.

37:10.510 --> 37:12.030
You all know

37:12.110 --> 37:13.670
what happened recently.

37:13.910 --> 37:15.830
The evil possessing technique has been occurring frequently.

37:15.830 --> 37:18.110
Even Tanghua couldn't escape it.

37:18.750 --> 37:20.550
Generals Xiazhi and Chiyi

37:20.550 --> 37:22.230
met with unfortunate and tragic deaths.

37:22.510 --> 37:23.270
This possessing technique

37:23.270 --> 37:25.180
is a unique secret art of the War Demons.

37:25.390 --> 37:26.190
Everyone,

37:27.110 --> 37:29.190
the War Demons are about to make a comeback.

37:29.550 --> 37:31.180
Are we prepared?

37:35.320 --> 37:36.400
High Priest, what about you?

37:37.220 --> 37:38.670
Are you ready to face

37:38.670 --> 37:40.070
the next Battle of Pinghu?

37:52.110 --> 37:53.750
I suddenly remembered

37:54.630 --> 37:55.830
that I've never raised fish.

38:13.560 --> 38:14.850
Take another look at this one.

38:16.150 --> 38:17.510
I embroidered Yaoshan.

38:17.870 --> 38:19.270
Remember when we attended

38:19.270 --> 38:20.910
the White Crane Immortal's birthday banquet together?

38:23.430 --> 38:24.830
Look at this green color

38:25.010 --> 38:25.890
and threads.

38:26.310 --> 38:27.230
Isn't it beautiful?

38:28.310 --> 38:29.590
I used the green lotus from the Jade Pool

38:29.590 --> 38:30.630
to color it.

38:31.150 --> 38:32.070
Each thread

38:32.070 --> 38:34.190
is extracted from the green lotus flowers.

38:34.790 --> 38:35.790
Not one flower too many,

38:35.990 --> 38:37.020
not one flower too few.

38:37.350 --> 38:38.070
That's what created

38:38.070 --> 38:39.790
this perfectly natural color.

38:39.930 --> 38:40.890
Hannv,

38:41.630 --> 38:42.630
I have to go.

38:43.260 --> 38:45.140
Go? Why?

38:45.470 --> 38:46.670
We haven't finished looking yet.

38:46.750 --> 38:47.670
I really have something to do.

38:47.670 --> 38:48.870
I can't stay any longer.

38:49.230 --> 38:50.230
I've broadened my horizons today

38:50.230 --> 38:51.390
and feasted my eyes.

38:51.430 --> 38:52.630
I'll see more next time if I have the chance.

38:52.630 --> 38:53.390
Farewell.

38:54.870 --> 38:55.670
Tanyin.

38:57.590 --> 38:59.190
High Priest, you are humorous.

38:59.390 --> 39:00.950
No wonder you're so relaxed.

39:00.950 --> 39:02.550
After all, you have the divine artifact in hand.

39:02.710 --> 39:04.630
Even if the War Demons rise from the ashes,

39:05.150 --> 39:06.620
it'd be a suicide mission.

39:06.830 --> 39:08.230
With the High Priest around,

39:08.430 --> 39:10.750
no matter what tricks the War Demons have,

39:10.970 --> 39:12.210
there's nothing to fear.

39:12.360 --> 39:13.150
Indeed.

39:13.390 --> 39:14.430
When the time comes,

39:14.430 --> 39:16.350
we'll just cheer from the sidelines

39:16.650 --> 39:19.160
and watch the High Priest show his power.

39:19.580 --> 39:20.500
That's right.

39:24.600 --> 39:25.480
High Priest,

39:26.000 --> 39:27.270
you are the savior

39:27.340 --> 39:28.940
and a meritorious figure of the Youhu Clan.

39:29.500 --> 39:30.550
But in recent years,

39:30.890 --> 39:32.330
you haven't been treated well.

39:32.830 --> 39:33.550
You haven't received

39:33.550 --> 39:35.150
the treatment befitting your merits.

39:35.400 --> 39:37.570
I feel guilty about this.

39:38.100 --> 39:39.710
But now, with a great enemy before us,

39:39.910 --> 39:41.670
the mortal realm needs your protection.

39:41.750 --> 39:43.150
I hope you can put aside past grievances

39:43.280 --> 39:44.430
and take up

39:44.430 --> 39:45.710
your rightful duties,

39:45.950 --> 39:47.750
living up to the divine artifact's choice.

39:48.940 --> 39:50.580
Elder Xinyao, why do you say this?

39:51.230 --> 39:53.400
These years, I've focused on cultivation

39:53.430 --> 39:54.460
without handling politics.

39:54.960 --> 39:56.950
I've consumed vast resources of the clan.

39:57.310 --> 39:58.320
Not only

39:58.510 --> 40:00.060
have the Elders not blamed me,

40:00.370 --> 40:02.330
but have also helped me greatly.

40:03.340 --> 40:04.740
Especially Elder Dingxu,

40:05.280 --> 40:06.350
who expends energy

40:06.520 --> 40:08.430
every few days to help me with spirit refinement.

40:09.270 --> 40:10.830
I can't thank him enough.

40:11.990 --> 40:13.260
How can I possibly complain?

40:13.620 --> 40:15.100
The High Priest is right.

40:15.530 --> 40:17.560
We are all of the same clan.

40:17.910 --> 40:19.750
Even if there were any unpleasant matters,

40:19.750 --> 40:20.690
haven't they all passed?

40:20.750 --> 40:22.360
The High Priest is generous

40:22.470 --> 40:23.950
and won't dwell on such things.

40:24.290 --> 40:26.340
Xinyao, rest assured.

40:30.110 --> 40:31.950
Since this is the general consensus

40:32.470 --> 40:34.230
and the High Priest is generous,

40:34.370 --> 40:35.840
let's get to the main point.

40:36.910 --> 40:37.910
Elder Dingxu,

40:38.110 --> 40:40.130
I remember you used the Heaven-Turning Seal

40:40.130 --> 40:41.950
to collect the magical powers of all the Elders

40:42.310 --> 40:43.660
and infused the golden hoop

40:43.660 --> 40:45.350
with crucial restrictions.

40:45.590 --> 40:47.990
Now, to undo the seal,

40:47.990 --> 40:49.030
we need it again.

40:49.480 --> 40:51.360
May I ask where this seal is?

40:53.710 --> 40:54.710
Elder Dingxu.

41:07.020 --> 41:07.820
Wait.

41:15.990 --> 41:16.790
Hannv, why do you

41:16.790 --> 41:18.150
insist on keeping me here?

41:18.420 --> 41:19.990
Has something happened down there

41:20.020 --> 41:21.410
that makes it inconvenient for me to return?

41:21.550 --> 41:22.590
I am not one of the Thunder Division's gods.

41:22.590 --> 41:23.840
I don't have time to argue with you.

41:24.030 --> 41:25.510
I only know that Deity Taihe

41:25.510 --> 41:26.630
is the master of heaven and earth,

41:26.630 --> 41:27.430
the one who governs

41:27.430 --> 41:28.510
the order and laws of all things.

41:28.550 --> 41:29.310
His existence

41:29.310 --> 41:31.270
is more important than anyone or anything else.

41:31.270 --> 41:32.390
You can't be reckless about this.

41:32.460 --> 41:33.580
It's not like that.

41:34.230 --> 41:35.190
Hannv,

41:35.280 --> 41:36.430
do you remember

41:36.430 --> 41:37.830
the first lesson

41:38.090 --> 41:39.580
you taught me as my guide

41:39.600 --> 41:41.040
when I first ascended?

41:41.350 --> 41:42.870
You took me to

41:42.870 --> 41:44.320
the Divine Palace of the Immortal Emperor.

41:44.350 --> 41:45.910
There was a scale of fairness there

41:46.310 --> 41:47.870
that could weigh all things in the world.

41:48.170 --> 41:49.440
We weighed three pairs of things.

41:49.630 --> 41:50.590
They were

41:50.630 --> 41:52.310
the patriotic heart of a scholar

41:52.620 --> 41:54.540
and the family concerns of common people;

41:54.710 --> 41:56.230
100 years of cultivation by the immortal race

41:56.250 --> 41:57.860
and the one-day lifespan of a mayfly;

41:58.190 --> 41:59.790
the thousands of miles a devout believer travels

41:59.790 --> 42:00.830
after a religious ceremony

42:01.150 --> 42:02.470
and the short distance from bedroom to shrine,

42:02.470 --> 42:04.110
which takes only half a cup of tea's time.

42:04.150 --> 42:04.950
You asked me,

42:04.950 --> 42:06.150
"Which is lighter, which is heavier?

42:06.150 --> 42:07.030
Which is higher, which is lower?'

42:07.030 --> 42:08.150
Which is more valuable, which is less?"

42:08.420 --> 42:09.820
The result was the same.

42:09.830 --> 42:10.990
They all weighed the same.

42:11.950 --> 42:13.190
This is the way of the gods.

42:13.730 --> 42:14.850
All beings are equal.

42:21.320 --> 42:22.590
All beings can be equal,

42:22.670 --> 42:23.870
but Taihe is different.

42:25.190 --> 42:26.470
What's different about him?

42:27.150 --> 42:28.950
Isn't he one of all beings?

42:28.950 --> 42:30.030
If gods believe that they're not part of

42:30.030 --> 42:31.070
"all beings,"

42:31.190 --> 42:32.870
then can that still be truly fair?

42:33.150 --> 42:34.750
The primordial power chose the gods.

42:34.830 --> 42:35.550
If the gods

42:35.550 --> 42:37.350
could act as they please,

42:37.390 --> 42:38.950
wouldn't the world fall into chaos?

42:39.270 --> 42:40.900
Deity Taihe is the Primordial God.

42:40.900 --> 42:41.630
His contributions to heaven

42:41.630 --> 42:42.910
and the mortal realm are immeasurable.

42:43.140 --> 42:44.710
If all this can be easily abandoned,

42:44.710 --> 42:45.830
how can we speak of fairness?

42:45.870 --> 42:47.430
Deity Taihe won't die.

42:47.710 --> 42:48.910
He hasn't been abandoned.

42:48.910 --> 42:50.390
He just needs to wait a while.

42:51.110 --> 42:52.430
He is an ancient god

42:52.510 --> 42:53.830
who has lived for hundreds of thousands of years.

42:54.110 --> 42:55.390
Even when he takes a nap,

42:55.390 --> 42:56.710
he sleeps for a hundred years.

42:56.990 --> 42:58.430
Can't we allow mortal beings

42:58.430 --> 43:00.190
and Yuanzhong to see more of

43:00.190 --> 43:01.270
this world?

43:04.280 --> 43:05.910
No wonder Deity Shangshan

43:05.950 --> 43:07.630
wanted to set rules with you.

43:08.320 --> 43:09.400
You've become emotional

43:09.750 --> 43:11.440
and lost your rationality.

43:11.590 --> 43:12.430
You're the one who has

43:12.430 --> 43:13.790
become emotional and irrational,

43:13.790 --> 43:14.630
not me.

43:16.630 --> 43:17.570
Hannv,

43:17.680 --> 43:19.170
I know you're an incense deity

43:19.390 --> 43:20.790
with many eyes and ears in the mortal realm.

43:20.790 --> 43:22.470
You must know what's about to happen.

43:22.470 --> 43:24.180
Yuanzhong must be in danger,

43:24.270 --> 43:25.710
and that's why you're trying to stop me from going back.

43:25.960 --> 43:26.750
But it won't work.

43:27.190 --> 43:28.220
You can't stop me.
